<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23464" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δάρδᾰνος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Dardanus,</i> son of Zeus,
			founder of Dardania or Troy, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				20.215
			</span></i>: Adj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δάρδανος ἀνήρ</span>”
				<i>Trojan,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.701
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				16.807
			</span></i>: mostly pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρῶες καὶ Δάρδανοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.456
				</span></i>
			, al.:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρδάνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i>Trojan,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2.819
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρδάνειος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				840
			</span></i> (lyr.):—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρδανίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <i>Trojan woman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.122
			</span></i>; also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώνειον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.78
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρδανία</span></b>  (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>), ἡ, <i>Troy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				20.216
			</span></i>:<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">—Δαρδανίδης,</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ,
			<i>son</i> or <i>descendant of Dardanus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				3.303
			</span></i>, al.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρδανίωνες</span></b> ,
				οἱ, <i>sons of Dardanus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				7.414
			</span></i>.</div>
